Algorithms
----------

Van Wijk smooth zoom interpolation
  Ported from d3-interpolate (https://github.com/d3/d3-interpolate)
  License: ISC
  Copyright: 2010-2021 Mike Bostock
  Based on: "Smooth and efficient zooming and panning" by Jarke J. van Wijk
    and Wim A.A. Nuij (IEEE InfoVis 2003)


